{%- doc -%}
  Theme-defined Product Highlights, keyed by product handle. One highlight per
  line as icon|Title|Description, where icon is a name from product-highlight-icon.
  main-product shows these after any custom.product_icons metaobject highlights,
  so a product with both gets both. Outputs nothing for a handle not listed here.

  @param {string} handle - Product handle

  @example
  {% capture lines %}{% render 'product-highlights-data', handle: product.handle %}{% endcapture %}
{%- enddoc -%}

